b7fcf0\"><code>c99d55b</code></a>\nReplace deprecated pycurl IOCTLFUNCTION callback with SEEKFUNCTION</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/27614316ef8ad125fe18725cf96e384560ba0e14\"><code>2761431</code></a>\nMerge pull request <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/issues/3587\">#3587</a>\nfrom bdarnell/fix-link</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/compare/v6.5.5...v6.5.6\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=tornado&package-manager=uv&previous-version=6.5.5&new-version=6.5.6)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\nYou can disable automated security fix PRs for this repo from the\n[Security Alerts\npage](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/network/alerts).\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5925224449014373a77e3a5b41e5c3c313e785d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/5925224449014373a77e3a5b41e5c3c313e785d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/31caa7be6b2504523188ecd50fca4c0700a3b76e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLHVwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASBIQABvBQRGUTVsq8zpNdzownbKI\nhrwvBUvDj2bCRx3Jt98G5N0a1kWG1q5gagfP6hKNup+nP1klHBo/sUdFOf5zxTF+\nuh9nGM63FA8SL+bIYDXp4bsHchpJlqQHQpkrkxUOi+r35OfNzRp260L41ih/vSX/\n+IY7wPyDJuCK4YZ2wUuXfeeMcuRxbaaBuyNJ8D7JVcrCvG3rUUL1DgJOfDXXYc5Y\nzgeRcAp9y7MlYPsBYLfLJyIpC6zU83qEEVsPNYEk/7j+o+KLoxL4PEvT6DOLhsEs\nvXwU51kI44L9Ekgip0Oo7Gt0RUgso5YTZICEF035NOsVymNyj6xORMfgyKoqNMqw\n5K4fU7K2Rm81DfDxCDX4H0L1uZ7tECWALLXOLETfFXjwFkIC7kpuLgM0v2oauVHV\nOAg2LGZO+RSkcCbxtTghgvt0xivL04ofNaZRQHvtQXdufWLflZBBnqQjuJzE4lxq\nt0TZ+aPw/b+PD+l7kAavHFPME21MbmOmq8z2jnRcx192y9U8F21vMbRTEkAyCMCO\nDWkjMn/WRq1kjrKt2iJEDxRls6b7KttPM6QVL/nUPmLTDwqSfMLgg7uM8yIpixNW\nBFv/LNJcGXyqtqb59ht97o8bIEGdqoque98lgxdSUlB6nVYrzOObBZ4Md1ZAnIob\n6E2ZzZB/spdpOTNyRwn9\n=hDnV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5925224449014373a77e3a5b41e5c3c313e785d1\nparent 505faa070f13e5dba69c12399eda1eeb9be6a557\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1781298544 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781298544 -0400\n\nchore(deps): bump tornado from 6.5.5 to 6.5.6 in /examples/deep_research (#3932)\n\nBumps [tornado](https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado) from 6.5.5 to\n6.5.6.\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sou