e` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\nYou can disable automated security fix PRs for this repo from the\n[Security Alerts\npage](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/network/alerts).\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-12T21:09:05Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/31caa7be6b2504523188ecd50fca4c0700a3b76e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/31caa7be6b2504523188ecd50fca4c0700a3b76e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/31caa7be6b2504523188ecd50fca4c0700a3b76e/comments","author":{"login":"dependabot[bot]","id":49699333,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"505faa070f13e5dba69c12399eda1eeb9be6a557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/505faa070f13e5dba69c12399eda1eeb9be6a557","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/505faa070f13e5dba69c12399eda1eeb9be6a557"}]},{"sha":"505faa070f13e5dba69c12399eda1eeb9be6a557","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDUwNWZhYTA3MGYxM2U1ZGJhNjljMTIzOTllZGExZWViOWJlNmE1NTc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-12T21:07:20Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-12T21:07:20Z"},"message":"build(deps): raise LangChain and LangGraph minimums (#3931)\n\nRaises the monorepo's core LangChain dependency floor so packages and\nexamples resolve against the latest compatible `langchain`,\n`langchain-core`, and `langgraph` patch releases. Adds a `make lock\nno-cache` path so lock regeneration can bypass cached package metadata\nwhen newly published versions need to be picked up.\n\n## Changes\n- Raises direct `langchain` constraints across packages and examples to\n`>=1.3.9,<2.0.0`.\n- Raises direct `langchain-core` constraints in `deepagents` and\n`langchain-quickjs` to `>=1.4.7,<2.0.0`.\n- Raises direct `langgraph` constraints in packages and examples to\n`>=1.2.5`, preserving existing upper bounds where present.\n- Adds `LOCK_ARGS` and a `no-cache` phony target so `make lock no-cache`\npasses `--no-cache` through each `uv lock` invocation.","tree":{"sha":"e3062e03db6e2897b6cabd9f46bd6a68f2e869f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/e3062e03db6e2897b6cabd9f46bd6a68f2e869f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/505faa070f13e5dba69c12399eda1eeb9be6a557","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLHUICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgPYQACIMhf1VC9IWgC8BKtf/2i4k\nLOo4GeUh7SyHLBVEcaN04TsSJbmfcAgG0h4bdZaoDg3odRCUA8hDHln4tJv05roz\nMajjOLY++mDFgQBp5J91i+ObT5sdg97f2z9MAaCFi/Ke8MUZInd/B5xUkGZgF51+\nQFMblCyLkH0v5VCSNFvGKafhqvfpiVCymMHXjuO1avvokvSMLN8izaZld0NMqnnC\nfPQj/p1KB6jci2NiBY/1Wuau4LGhggg93bgM/ttELQSqYNUYKSBfmTASGxfbDplM\ntoWcA9GQWJt8MS94sBUOCwJco7nOd2uqePdjRX+uKsR88hw2sYbdtxs4VUOaxifX\nC1qXAVorjdRMgSRKYuiZD8JHeNzOC9AFfLv6TH1Q2Az09d0HDAM/APwzCDQVdMfI\nq1Rn5my+xKPMgOdnpW5ocpsXAEweC3bCCXme+i/j2cL0yQ4qTyrUGe9HHgfKwY+F\nrxx4Nv5gyvx0Bj86mzmJdmQbF++eKHZpUacnA56K/ZrdaZJhliMrUjG36EDBlhGs\n6vH9dEx5NP/eyYcFVdRbSGpPz+hTdcgJtjhT+QaIpIuR5E8h/zXX7m+F0ZeCtBqZ\nC0LPH5vYGuVNBtFJlo4fii1tt2VCWHiI4QnqqhTd/lAtUS/gTsoxbAKIJRmjlzLU\n0t1u4DEWTwGmFrwXujkn\n=A+pR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e3062e03db6e2897b6cabd9f46bd6a68f2e869f6\nparent 64b4b9cee7f6c6699c91b863b8dcbfb27e8fa69d\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781298440 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781298440 -0400\n\nbuild(deps): raise LangChain and LangGraph minimums (#3931)\n\nRaises the monorepo's core LangChain dependency floor so packages and\nexamples resolve against the latest compatible `langchain`,\n`langchain-core`, and `langgraph` patch releases. Adds a `make lock\nno-cache` path so lock regeneration can bypass cached package metadata\nwhen newly published versions need to be picked up.\n\n## Changes\n- Raises direct `langchain` constraints across packages and examples to\n`>=1.3.9,<2.0.0`.\n- Raises direct `langchain-core` constraints in `deepagents` and\n`langchain-quickjs` to `>=1.4.7,<2.0.0`.\n- Raises direct `langgraph` constraints in packages and examples to\n`>=1.2.5`, preserving existing upper bounds where present.\n- Adds `LOCK_ARGS` and a `no-cache` phony target so `make lock no-cache`\npasses `--no-cache` through each `uv lock` invocation.","verified_at":"2026-06-12T21:07:21Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/505faa070f13e5dba69c12399eda1eeb9be6a557","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/505faa070f13e5dba69c12399eda1eeb9be6a557","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/505faa070f13e5dba69c12399eda1eeb9be6a557/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"64b4b9cee7f6c6699c91b863b8dcbfb27e8fa69d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/64b4b9cee7f6c6699c91b863b8dcbfb27e8fa69d","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/64b4b9cee7f6c6699c91b863b8dcbfb27e8fa69d"}]},{"sha":"64b4b9cee7f6c6699c91b863b8dcbfb27e8fa69d","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDY0YjRiOWNlZTdmNmM2Njk5YzkxYjg2M2I4ZGNiZmIyN2U4ZmE2OWQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-12T20:57:31Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-12T20:57:31Z"},"message":"release(langchain-quickjs): 0.2.0 (#3852)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.2.0](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/langchain-quickjs==0.1.4...langchain-quickjs==0.2.0)\n(2026-06-12)\n\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* **quickjs:** add default `subagent` bridge\n([#3850](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3850))\n* **quickjs:** remove `skills_backend`\n([#3843](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3843))\n\n### Features\n\n* **quickjs:** add default `subagent` bridge\n([#3850](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3850))\n([85fd7c2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/85fd7c283da6744e403a01861e17e99e13e0f481))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **quickjs:** remove `skills_backend`\n([#3843](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3843))\n([1159e50](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/1159e504abaeec4f81d5e777ecde6a6cee641edb))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e6493cc5034653c63fc5f21d1a18779a16c370d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/2e6493cc5034653c63fc5f21d1a18779a16c370d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/gi