low/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"02a7ff63a374397dfeecfb7cfa2faeaf68ee95e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/02a7ff63a374397dfeecfb7cfa2faeaf68ee95e8","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/02a7ff63a374397dfeecfb7cfa2faeaf68ee95e8"}]},{"sha":"02a7ff63a374397dfeecfb7cfa2faeaf68ee95e8","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDAyYTdmZjYzYTM3NDM5N2RmZWVjZmI3Y2ZhMmZhZWFmNjhlZTk1ZTg","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-12T06:09:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-12T06:09:58Z"},"message":"release(deepagents-code): 0.1.14 (#3894)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.14](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.13...deepagents-code==0.1.14)\n(2026-06-12)\n\n### Features\n\n* Surface editable mode and core deps in `/version`\n([#3898](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3898))\n([d4f5a12](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d4f5a12cc6d73dc19d24d5748242705d79fa65bf))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Don't move cursor on click that re-focuses terminal\n([#3893](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3893))\n([b76788b](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b76788b7850e910fe2882cb1a62ffff6ff5085b0))\n* Label `-r` resume as `\"Resuming...\"` in the status bar\n([#3892](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3892))\n([70cd286](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/70cd28643bc2ca7da5a61a7b7203c6de2266ca4e))\n* Scope `@` file completion to current cwd\n([#3874](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3874))\n([dd237ac](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/dd237acd21a39e98e37bb9d98dfae09bc44d5457))\n* Set dcode agent names in trace metadata\n([#3901](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3901))\n([ac94dd6](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ac94dd6b139211187cad8685c1152f02c51ba086))\n* Surface untracked files in `@` completion\n([#3872](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3872))\n([2bdf6ea](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2bdf6ea329c6b4c8be5f0075528e00c7ce2c1e6a))\n* Warn on misconfigured subagent files\n([#3873](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3873))\n([f1614d6](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f1614d67827c3d4d3bd01a784f57f83a50ec3410))\n\n### Performance Improvements\n\n* Cache theme colors/charset, fix `O(n^2)` tool-call streaming\n([#3881](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3881))\n([9d463f5](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9d463f52fb3a4d458477982963f3d278d5362b48))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"81ad790e54584ae0027b9f8e31256162dc8c6dfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/81ad790e54584ae0027b9f8e31256162dc8c6dfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/02a7ff63a374397dfeecfb7cfa2faeaf68ee95e8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqK6K2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdDYQAEkOZtymu9inviFoyoyJnpMp\n1/AJq3GMTitjRgX4B3Klhtry4nfvkx3CxUo5WJwKyVvSalsOHrf8/+ygt/2Ystm2\n9leGuOjdi5bIKhkzMjiWZNFfLE4/zzLwP9XzveRUNRuMN7uMbwTk2ZY6oatQdWp2\nuQpnh6WYhbBOrRGX3HEtuz34kWxaucPJEmSrl5n8hR2natMGsCZDRHjIcz4bLnSC\nFls1aqkFc9gLApZfMen6Bda2IL0U9fVSnFJXMde3wkTYNmfM3QppC+K5IQonRxmU\nORNtSDv75F1H+QKABkdzTnVCZXUh/48rAsyVlKpnaZ4Qb59ijDtxLrxMyZf9NBhq\n8tcwNXLqTX5VeFJx5kbe/O6rWhs69pLNXImFIEnqOjccBqrqok9x9NSx4u0YYOBA\n3MXnZgxa9uE2nZeSgfvknCZZmMKhGqaUhQ94Gi5EYoFyFFBAReCeyWmwNZ4QWPFs\nDFQ2TgBw0iin9JmlzdBCkxjxg+am4Jf1RlplKKcZhU2s/h5mCXsDtmBIqS9yw9Kp\nJOwlA7sKxHg2Co9lYKBwErp8cFduDsLq2YfPJ6NJil5o49R8TQAjkb2+hmmtXpjP\nX1O1JGnb4MNSaE/EbQNr4/TKkBuqhuX+CEPfOKlP0tvRhIHn8EnWnS5Jk+18Jyfq\nSDqDg9YhYb9X2LfBxlpV\n=sI41\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 81ad790e54584ae0027b9f8e31256162dc8c6dfe\nparent f48b547b809dcde352db508217b58a848e8619bc\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1781244598 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781244598 -0400\n\nrelease(deepagents-code): 0.1.14 (#3894)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.14](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.13...deepagents-code==0.1.14)\n(2026-06-12)\n\n### Features\n\n* Surface editable mode and core deps in `/version`\n([#3898](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3898))\n([d4f5a12](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d4f5a12cc6d73dc19d24d5748242705d79fa65bf))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Don't move cursor on click that re-focuses terminal\n([#3893](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3893))\n([b76788b](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b76788b7850e910fe2882cb1a62ffff6ff5085b0))\n* Label `-r` resume as `\"Resuming...\"` in the status bar\n([#3892](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3892))\n([70cd286](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/70cd28643bc2ca7da5a61a7b7203c6de2266ca4e))\n* Scope `@` file completion to current cwd\n([#3874](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3874))\n([dd237ac](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/dd237acd21a39e98e37bb9d98dfae09bc44d5457))\n* Set dcode agent names in trace metadata\n([#3901](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3901))\n([ac94dd6](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ac94dd6b139211187cad8685c1152f02c51ba086))\n* Surface untracked files in `@` completion\n([#3872](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3872))\n([2bdf6ea](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2bdf6ea329c6b4c8be5f0075528e00c7ce2c1e6a))\n* Warn on misconfigured subagent files\n([#3873](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3873))\n([f1614d6](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f1614d67827c3d4d3bd01a784f57f83a50ec3410))\n\n### Performance Improvements\n\n* Cache theme colors/charset, fix `O(n^2)` tool-call streaming\n([#3881](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3881))\n([9d463f5](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9d463f52fb3a4d458477982963f3d278d5362b48))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-12T06:09:58Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/02a7ff63a374397dfeecfb7cfa2faeaf68ee95e8","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/02a7ff63a374397dfeecfb7cfa2faeaf68ee95e8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/02a7ff63a374397dfeecfb7cfa2faeaf68ee95e8/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f48b547b809dcde352db508217b58a848e8619bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f48b547b809dcde352db508217b58a848e8619bc","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f48b547b809dcde352db508217b58a848e8619bc"}]},{"sha":"f48b547b809dcde352db508217b58a848e8619bc","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGY0OGI1NDdiODA5ZGNkZTM1MmRiNTA4MjE3YjU4YTg0OGU4NjE5YmM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-12T05:56:36Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-12T05:56:36Z"},"message":"hotfix(code): keep tracked files when untracked scan fails (#3907)\n\nFixed `@` file completion dropping deeply-nested tracked files when the\nuntracked-file scan timed out in large repositories.\n\n---\n\n`_get_project_files` built `@`-completion results from two `git\nls-files` calls and only returned the git-backed list when *both*\nsucceeded. That made the optional untracked scan (`--others\n--exclude-standard`) a hard dependency: if it failed or exceeded the 5s\ntimeout in a large repo, the already-successful tracked listing was\nthrown away and completion fell back to a glob walk that only descends a\nfew levels — silently dropping deep tracked files.\n\nThe tracked listing is now authoritative. The untracked scan only\naugments it, and its failure no longer triggers the glob fallback.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"81ea93827698a5add0e725bb5d00a1cfff428a44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/81ea93827698a5add0e725bb5d00a1cfff428a44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/f48b547b809dcde352db508217b58a848e8619bc","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqK5+UCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYCIQAENYxdO8yKH3sR9oqhnYXqft\nKjalkuaPWma1qBCSA6Vy/yHaj2Xgy0iPiGIQvhh87CKsoTyue4cn9/AAyB3TA7H9\nQhihBm21WRkQLaZosgZrt0PEtArQ9uhVGKoQoWPI+HmSzno+GfidQ1OzCE1o266q\nseSaMikS4SnwFQjsXXQJ2wHW7isWP3y5Mmc0K+p6NomqiV1j6Krgbavs3mjapTRZ\nNduN6jHlVkLCwg/fMuznKZYHXbQWG0i+On9m2xXusPh7jUkBPXybJ2hI58ZIEHtt\nJGkmvOd6ikLy0KKYVnZJQKs8j+p40UmuuXFjtv9gxQ7ktcJKryO4jsuQgMFqEcXA\nQNcP9Rm4JSucVX5nAYrxa3H+hIcORbcst6YFDCSl9OdXjwZ0oPObv5MSXrC92v4A\n03OWXlwWBGxUyaDPpf/JR294QHL4mJuPkE+z9eD+aPbJEKYcPX1lOpYVidkZ7HB3\nXYkm3t5wCPKbpm6VvnCa0tHGTfYcPplg8F9Yt2KXI76VQQse4huH9oD/zd0M8c2r\nT733qmeMeWktvDg2hB0VKgBddEhN+4sLlOFXWOuav0LFHhqBhpo/cuAl3LjUhP1T\nLydboqKG8xCwjoq7EZOR1hl4dFVGypKeTMNqOTDljJ2XOt5JfWvcmyrPXNC5lLvz\n8MO08Q0QtBLuWfn2awTh\n=vvZG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 81ea93827698a5add0e725bb5d00a1cfff428a44\nparent a043c5a6717374c405a3ed740cfdafdd196f5f21\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781243796 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781243796 -0400\n\nhotfix(code): keep tracked files when untracked scan fails (#3907)\n\nFixed `@` file completion dropping deeply-nested tracked files when the\nuntracked-file scan timed out in large repositories.\n\n---\n\n`_get_project_files` built `@`-completion results from two `git\nls-files` calls and only returned the git-backed list when *both*\nsucceeded. That made the optional untracked scan (`--others\n--exclude-standard`) a hard dependency: if it failed or exceeded the 5s\ntimeout in a large repo, the already-successful tracked listing was\nthrown away and completion fell back to a glob walk that only descends a\nfew levels — silently dropping deep tracked files.\n\nThe tracked listing is now authoritative. The untracked scan only\naugments it, and its failure no longer triggers the glob fallback.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-12T05:56:36Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f48b547b809dcde352db508217b58a848e8619bc","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f48b547b809dcde352db508217b58a848e8619bc","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f48b547b809dcde352db508217b58a848e8619bc/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"a043c5a6717374c405a3ed740cfdafdd196f5f21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a043c5a6717374c405a3ed740cfdafdd196f5f21","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/a043c5a6717374c405a3ed740cfdafdd196f5f21"}]},{"sha":"a043c5a6717374c405a3ed740cfdafdd196f5f21","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGEwNDNjNWE2NzE3Mzc0YzQwNWEzZWQ3NDBjZmRhZmRkMTk2ZjVmMjE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-12T05:33:31Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-12T05:33:31Z"},"message":"fix(sdk): handle `Overwrite`-wrapped messages in tool result interception (#3905)\n\nCloses #3899\n\nFixed a `TypeError: 'Overwrite' object is not iterable` that could occur\nduring large tool-result eviction when using store-backed memory.\n\n---\n\nWhen eviction fires, `FilesystemMiddleware` emits a `Command` whose\n`messages` update is wrapped in `langgraph.types.Overwrite`, which\ncarries a single `.value` attribute and is not iterable.\n`_intercept_large_tool_result` (and its async counterpart) assumed\n`messages` was always a plain list and iterated over it directly,\nraising `TypeError: 'Overwrite' object is not iterable`. This caused\nstore-backed memory writes to fail silently and the agent to fall back\nto unrelated paths.\n\nThe fix detects the `Overwrite` wrapper, unwraps its `.value` before\nprocessing the messages, then re-wraps the processed list so the\nchannel-overwrite semantics are preserved.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e4aba7a9c0cd4724940b760e3cb629c36315a7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/7e4aba7a9c0cd4724940b760e3cb629c36315a7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/a043c5a6717374c405a3ed740cfdafdd196f5f21","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqK5orCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAgQQAJFrN4sNoS0i7Mw1HQRcvbA5\nLrKzi6+9yjf4M/YHX0G6gnQp27hHUCVAzE7hpQgLsh+zOkUOdk497vMm7lf1kL25\nHZtDsi6HQ1cAoQdRcjfqKpxTP6T5ON1w8UsFHTKLCiuA3TkCusVw9ZJp6X9x244R\n2qDFtUcgM1BCVPerqEjqfP6VMhL5rzvmGkFctY/XgW21VrK3Ov1nrlRlSZqCGkR4\nJwgbk7MqyGMSsQHtwif1XTeWACYOhVoXP5+H3JZwKHPMsKhJAYtiE0SopDqhmDuz\nYCzqrn388KvPz4S9IwMQMmf2VZtESCK/9izzFUH9+PeMnLENMP7JN3GxxiYK6dd6\nQRkCEjyhckMAJPWpYfEuNnwcUWVH8XdzAJFmiLFC7epe3mLtfqXjXy73b650lYPc\nNKbLGlkkwmdzzVMTiHnOR0QiSt89L7szr5nEXc4nat+J23zQN9AOci1OqldafgOg\nhq4L4BMzfI5Zu4lbWdWYUK9MH2qa6bhCS9KyAiP/p+XiIX3FWRUzQaU7GozdMqbt\nncHsyMK5NHBuS8PrdCfltEaYlQNwRUNgkF3uLYx9CpsvSAim6pFNwkfotzo5DgQS\nqv4Hx9K8h8oHEwUbs3PdWX6PGKBL/cYQUjSQUeFYVi4sp/c0xRORSWPh1n0JBrH+\nn4xcfF0cSoWo+eHhhjQK\n=gwwB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 7e4aba7a9c0cd4724940b760e3cb629c36315a7a\nparent 2bdf6ea329c6b4c8be5f0075528e00c7ce2c1e6a\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781242411 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781242411 -0400\n\nfix(sdk): handle `Overwrite`-wrapped messages in tool result interception (#3905)\n\nCloses #3899\n\nFixed a `TypeError: 'Overwrite' object is not iterable` that could occur\nduring large tool-result eviction when using store-backed memory.\n\n---\n\nWhen eviction fires, `FilesystemMiddleware` emits a `Command` whose\n`messages` update is wrapped in `langgraph.types.Overwrite`, which\ncarries a single `.value` attribute and is not iterable.\n`_intercept_large_tool_result` (and its async counterpart) assumed\n`messages` was always a plain list and iterated over it directly,\nraising `TypeError: 'Overwrite' object is not iterable`. This caused\nstore-backed memory writes to fail silently and the agent to fall back\nto unrelated paths.\n\nThe fix detects the `Overwrite` wrapper, unwraps its `.value` before\nprocessing the messages, then re-wraps the processed list so the\nchannel-overwrite semantics are preserved.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-12T05:33:32Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a043c5a6717374c405a3ed740cfdafdd196f5f21","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/a043c5a6717374c405a3ed740cfdafdd196f5f21","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a043c5a6717374c405a3ed740cfdafdd196f5f21/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"2bdf6ea329c6b4c8be5f0075528e00c7ce2c1e6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2bdf6ea329c6b4c8be5f0075528e00c7ce2c1e6a","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2bdf6ea329c6b4c8be5f0075528e00c7ce2c1e6a"}]},{"sha":"2bdf6ea329c6b4c8be5f0075528e00c7ce2c1e6a","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDJiZGY2ZWEzMjljNmI0YzhiZTVmMDA3NTUyOGUwMGM3Y2UyYzFlNmE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-12T05:15:36Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-12T05:15:36Z"},"message":"fix(code): surface untracked files in `@` completion (#3872)\n\nCloses #1615\n\n---\n\nThe `@` file-mention autocomplete only listed git-tracked files because\n`_get_project_files` relied solely on `git ls-files`, which reads the\nindex. Files created in the working tree but not yet committed never\nappeared in completion results.\n\nThis augments the file list with `git ls-files --others\n--exclude-standard`, which returns untracked files that are not ignored,\nand de-duplicates the combined result. Tracked files still come first.\nThe glob fallback (used when git is unavailable) is unchanged.\n\n## Self-Hosted Release Note\nThe `@` file picker now surfaces untracked (uncommitted, non-ignored)\nfiles in addition to tracked ones.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f66f7a121d1facd92e6ce3ffac1690272f10d7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/0f66f7a121d1facd92e6ce3ffac1690272f10d7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/2bdf6ea329c6b4c8be5f0075528e00c7ce2c1e6a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqK5X4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFlsQAInL4s/Qz+nSzQSYKLxOLHzU\nZ/DTc5RVJX1YCWVC5N02GZzGT3gbhypBq8g8OlWXHaumrTj8GevsJTXAxswdr+tS\ntJTCD/r5QIMVtCjbLqsmFr6ulIxg7gK007rbn5hmmvdZqAiC5eiD5tUjyE708sid\nAA4+VNp9F7RsO8Jv1R6m5XHkudUcSj3AHvaxFAUkBkthyDTG7M4jbhT6prq31cBf\noyJ+uFG7z1v8yye/fG6ZOXVPSOA10GwYNZ/2z5AAkU33soXb7gmJ+y4nZwIKtmcO\nxcTRjZcjNvD7Nks3Y35DyMnup48Cv1m80DMiMKdABTO879A310LYdfcP4VqO1+gP\n+O5EYOI+PZXrtcDy7Z/Ng7GnZJ4GS/FXjq2iRrq6CcXTARAxusexA7pojiUH/8A3\nxtCW6adoqs4tk7B+pu1IY8FF75JCzpj+SpFbH+QY/XipTUbF0ckOUO1ePkP6QP03\nTjPa1IYYWwqbd5LjLCo8/riCEz8hZ8nnwPoGT0xZyBMnaAfc5bXFakG68aYWJHKN\nKmqF5qTjl3YKkQE6LyAJ3b0Hku+cMmCYABgJelJGf0DcdJLfUa0PKVJAxcSc581+\nuJydaTYVCfRgrq3Nk+SiGfcT1Zu5bIrt3ZKeziKoxpTxFUUKBJ9jEBKh7dN0uzDv\nuAV1eHx21JoTsXA3yVOy\n=E61q\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 0f66f7a121d1facd92e6ce3ffac1690272f10d7c\nparent f1614d67827c3d4d3bd01a784f57f83a50ec3410\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781241336 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781241336 -0400\n\nfix(code): surface untracked files in `@` completion (#3872)\n\nCloses #1615\n\n---\n\nThe `@` file-mention autocomplete only listed git-tracked files because\n`_get_project_files` relied solely on `git ls-files`, which reads the\nindex. Files created in the working tree but not yet committed never\nappeared in completion results.\n\nThis augments the file list with `git ls-files --others\n--exclude-standard`, which returns untracked files that are not ignored,\nand de-duplicates the combined result. Tracked files still come first.\nThe glob fallback (used when git is unavailable) is unchanged.\n\n## Self-Hosted Release Note\nThe `@` file picker now surfaces untracked (uncommitted, non-ignored)\nfiles in addition to tracked ones.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-12T05:15:36Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2bdf6ea329c6b4c8be5f0075528e00c7ce2c1e6a","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2bdf6ea329c6b4c8be5f0075528e00c7ce2c1e6a","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2bdf6ea329c6b4c8be5f0075528e00c7ce2c1e6a/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f1614d67827c3d4d3bd01a784f57f83a50ec3410","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f1614d67827c3d4d3bd01a784f57f83a50ec3410","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f1614d67827c3d4d3bd01a784f57f83a50ec3410"}]},{"sha":"f1614d67827c3d4d3bd01a784f57f83a50ec3410","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGYxNjE0ZDY3ODI3YzNkNGQzYmQwMWE3ODRmNTdmODNhNTBlYzM0MTA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-12T04:53:03Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-12T04:53:03Z"},"message":"fix(code): warn on misconfigured subagent files (#3873)\n\nFixes #2322\n\nDeep Agents Code now warns when a custom subagent file is malformed or\nplaced at an unexpected path instead of silently ignoring it.\n\n---\n\nProject- and user-level subagent discovery silently ignored files that\nwere malformed or in the wrong location, so users migrating from a\nClaude Code structure (`agent.md` / `<name>.md` instead of\n`<name>/AGENTS.md`) got no feedback. Discovery now logs explanatory\nwarnings naming the file and the specific problem (missing frontmatter,\ninvalid/missing `name`/`description`/`model`, stray file in `agents/`,\nor a folder missing `AGENTS.md`).\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f605fe8cc124857a2744d0c4654fa01dbd53ffa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/f605fe8cc124857a2744d0c4654fa01dbd53ffa9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/f1614d67827c3d4d3bd01a784f57f83a50ec3410","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqK5CvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAK1wQAKkRjASFbmFYmiHjDO3AvV1h\n5OK8O28KuPCERDYTCjQ9mi0MPx87yfl2y37PEx9bcZ8YHKz4b38Mp+/s16smH5r8\nEXkApXVAW3fxQvtwe8cruy8wXUnjUybyhWFml+3lAsmpTccd87pfYi0WBd26W9ul\nviHOIgXgNPgYnbFJjXVXWKfy7Y7Zih6a4Zgh5UsaQ0TyT+x7xAjK4LJnGs9YAaiw\nSsqxSiFNzOvt8cXeuPyaRGDZg+Sq+z/7B+V/NMbicfX/PCNT2HwLia6/DYh4coYK\nWL9ByrVU0eCiYAi8mp+O9jhB6imbGNodycrtfIY12//m9dnJ0GKYAZyRlRE9L2Be\nVjz6dzHaWpGZN82tQOFbUwXrQOv9UxqKCiAl+OFLxxtjmzLoQY3knDcuhsPSNg5C\nLV9qLh3qr2mTLSyj6nRj3c6YcVkFQPhO2b8NjuWgtga4vKrWAEoNXCpadNYOmKTM\n2pyLRT7aqRcFWIT8hSZp0QxSqX8tm5rAlVjH1vvtjr9f1QcPJnhaHCgp9EooyCjd\nqp9SEq57Zd1iVyuvZWYeA1iAbxl8DQp7AQYQT5Qw6xc1fuPx2pJai4l2XdIBJzc3\n1A2z+myaWgraI+thgVTrN1wW/UTilbKymRFBy9ne2/Vf07UoWBd4M+A81jlvD1V4\nCcT1cayM43cg+rwnpYFo\n=Iciu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree f605fe8cc124857a2744d0c4654fa01dbd53ffa9\nparent dd237acd21a39e98e37bb9d98dfae09bc44d5457\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781239983 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781239983 -0400\n\nfix(code): warn on misconfigured subagent files (#3873)\n\nFixes #2322\n\nDeep Agents Code now warns when a custom subagent file is malformed or\nplaced at an unexpected path instead of silently ignoring it.\n\n---\n\nProject- and user-level subagent discovery silently ignored files that\nwere malformed or in the wrong location, so users migrating from a\nClaude Code structure (`agent.md` / `<name>.md` instead of\n`<name>/AGENTS.md`) got no feedback. Discovery now logs explanatory\nwarnings naming the file and the specific problem (missing frontmatter,\ninvalid/missing `name`/`description`/`model`, stray file in `agents/`,\nor a folder missing `AGENTS.md`).\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-12T04:53:04Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f1614d67827c3d4d3bd01a784f57f83a50ec3410","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f1614d67827c3d4d3bd01a784f57f83a50ec3410","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f1614d67827c3d4d3bd01a784f57f83a50ec3410/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"dd237acd21a39e98e37bb9d98dfae09bc44d5457","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/dd237acd21a39e98e37bb9d98dfae09bc44d5457","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/dd237acd21a39e98e37bb9d98dfae09bc44d5457"}]},{"sha":"dd237acd21a39e98e37bb9d98dfae09bc44d5457","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGRkMjM3YWNkMjFhMzllOThlMzdiYjlkOThkZmFlMDliYzQ0ZDU0NTc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-12T04:43:59Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-12T04:43:59Z"},"message":"fix(code): scope `@` file completion to current cwd (#3874)\n\nFixes #1093\n\n`@` file completion now suggests files relative to the current working\ndirectory instead of the repository root.\n\n---\n\n`@` file completion listed candidates from the git/project root even\nwhen the app was launched in a nested subdirectory. This scopes the\ncached candidate list to the current working directory subtree and\ndisplays suggestions relative to that cwd (e.g. `@main.py` instead of\n`@apps/cli/main.py`). Scoping is applied in both the synchronous\n`_get_files()` path and the off-event-loop `warm_cache()` path.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f18bf9f2339291c18fd4e0a2046d36c456c7d36c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/f18bf9f2339291c18fd4e0a2046d36c456c7d36c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/dd237acd21a39e98e37bb9d98dfae09bc44d5457","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqK46PCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMJoQAHLFq7Pi0nmebbGPq2zQarii\nXW+a1HYjqZE5w1B6uoO5yEMEIQ2toKB+nfD+B54m2KQA8pgN/ddNuyPA5Yr801Mw\nJY+Cb5/aB7RBvOaAAe2y5esPoFYjUWnB2G2M+KI7VmEhBMPurdkVFafJS5sZEC+e\nzRMmu/giLTjFc8NlZwG2bMaHDsyhtaJ3cKMhDcUR+HOQ59KzIzCJdjuJTKIrcBDA\nalNU3VY/ro0r1UtcPhuRVNUgmUJIDzL8I2MfNvisesixHCGzPBfR82BbdFdjygdV\nLOTO127l1S+g7aTDQSI9QyT5M32ZLSOjVa8/gaJYXLGl+9U1psb0LhmLyUNdPNVF\n0Kisg+CFwQBLLYj+iAkTnbMWuqoL2BfRyyETF/C0H14jtNokJWFrniyjuQcTsmpj\n52CvjsKWuapdXcIM4Ra7PKq1zhwP7Um0KXweIps6xesgcaBTqDRBDDRSiD5UcxOb\n1M6Xcm/KWFVzR2gRaWUfEupZMH685DhOuu6gnlBeCBoM3E6/nGodMa0Np1ppfrhO\nE2hFUMYdtIs1PK65jSDUbbUnrazioOZSySujaO5W8O7cePA30S2+ok0DIbECqVLc\nnTfr39fvCrLFD0Uz4Eg/Xw29z8ldWMS3iis0R6N59TufLY5bVIb7Yh/i/zefmEjP\nfhjBl6BhgR4Xe2pKfQ1A\n=kfCS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree f18bf9f2339291c18fd4e0a2046d36c456c7d36c\nparent 7c9eb0090880d0beeb494c7679573640c82132b2\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781239439 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781239439 -0400\n\nfix(code): scope `@` file completion to current cwd (#3874)\n\nFixes #1093\n\n`@` file completion now suggests files relative to the current working\ndirectory instead of the repository root.\n\n---\n\n`@` file completion listed candidates from the git/project root even\nwhen the app was launched in a nested subdirectory. This scopes the\ncached candidate list to the current working directory subtree and\ndisplays suggestions relative to that cwd (e.g. `@main.py` instead of\n`@apps/cli/main.py`). Scoping is applied in both the synchronous\n`_get_files()` path and the off-event-loop `warm_cache()` path.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-12T04:43:59Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/dd237acd21a39e98e37bb9d98dfae09bc44d5457","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/dd237acd21a39e98e37bb9d98dfae09bc44d5457","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/dd237acd21a39e98e37bb9d98dfae09bc44d5457/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_i