DOPTymldoAKDJmNDMyYmE2MzY4N2Q3Yzg0ODhkNWQ0MWQwNTUxZDAyYjRhZTAwYjQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-11T23:06:16Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-11T23:06:16Z"},"message":"perf(sdk): cache filesystem system prompts (#3889)\n\nAdds per-instance caching for the dynamic filesystem system prompt keyed\nby whether execution instructions are included.\n\nThe prompt only depends on immutable middleware configuration and the\nexecute-tool support flag, so this avoids rebuilding identical prompt\ntext before every model call.","tree":{"sha":"e818a9c3d061d751ceaddf16a5660d6674981f8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/e818a9c3d061d751ceaddf16a5660d6674981f8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/2f432ba63687d7c8488d5d41d0551d02b4ae00b4","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKz9oCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3wsQAIxNsQ5JctirmkSH0owenBRv\n79g1NVHAuBTQR4jkNWFt0n6bSy02aov8uXJa2dJ7J+sbmmTIzr1w/sf1CvG68PNt\nzHTSx2trIEMywm7Vj15vwgjk+0MhN+W2UJypT6LrnkE49tDzP7fWlR2IOILn46S2\nEj/cyYMz1+4bq+Nx8nzS6HsCDmzvyXpTAid9k8J9I4FTn/T1jmj4iGcDQB8Z9tRq\nmSr/wIAK46K9svltRS6Gf+62kKzxIX7mqoVgG3XHdxuIciub24HBx7dwKfpcZDbb\nrktUxmkKqB7/93jI2pd3upr5kdqnRIp5KUZGhdzjQPw/ZFDxiH0ixhuQqEr5fMOn\nzbCBy++aHiU4tl15yGw1pjO8kyJ4UuTHSminx3uLAzv4Mn1VD8awi1z+oid6Y2yJ\nfcfoITxZRag9IxzWIpMpOAoN6/wfA5stCaJcH+OF0pprI9RhWRueDj3aU3wFc4bK\n37RiDiEhOA1s4oMubAMoazutZ42OKTbLxQ5ybFjWeL/zmyO0t66cYk3s5Y7Gs8A/\nJ+51C1uOqs3ammyOwKH+G7KQ4ksGGhubtbyiQtxIGS3/5GmTs2QDMJd5vQwS4oww\n67XRadiFR6aNyPUteymFNubg6Wc3XHrmN71bRYwojEivKivAgdrgx/Toxqcf9aEe\n1KssFcwhUzhV1z6LSgbE\n=pH9W\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e818a9c3d061d751ceaddf16a5660d6674981f8f\nparent 85fd7c283da6744e403a01861e17e99e13e0f481\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781219176 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781219176 -0400\n\nperf(sdk): cache filesystem system prompts (#3889)\n\nAdds per-instance caching for the dynamic filesystem system prompt keyed\nby whether execution instructions are included.\n\nThe prompt only depends on immutable middleware configuration and the\nexecute-tool support flag, so this avoids rebuilding identical prompt\ntext before every model call.","verified_at":"2026-06-11T23:06:17Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2f432ba63687d7c8488d5d41d0551d02b4ae00b4","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2f432ba63687d7c8488d5d41d0551d02b4ae00b4","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2f432ba63687d7c8488d5d41d0551d02b4ae00b4/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"85fd7c283da6744e403a01861e17e99e13e0f481","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/85fd7c283da6744e403a01861e17e99e13e0f481","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/85fd7c283da6744e403a01861e17e99e13e0f481"}]},{"sha":"85fd7c283da6744e403a01861e17e99e13e0f481","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDg1ZmQ3YzI4M2RhNjc0NGU0MDNhMDE4NjFlMTdlOTllMTNlMGY0ODE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Hunter Lovell","email":"40191806+hntrl@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-11T23:04:48Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-11T23:04:48Z"},"message":"feat(quickjs)!: add default `subagent` bridge (#3850)\n\nAdds a default QuickJS `subagent()` global backed by the subagents\nconfigured on `create_deep_agent`. The bridge recreates subagents inside\nthe REPL from a private configurable payload, keeps subagent spec\nhandling out of middleware dispatcher state, and preserves private-state\nfiltering when invoking child agents.\n\nChanges:\n\n- Expose `create_sub_agent` as the shared helper for compiling\ndeclarative subagent specs, so the task tool path and QuickJS bridge use\nthe same construction path.\n- Expose normalized subagent specs from `SubAgentMiddleware` through\n`RunnableConfig.configurable` when constructing a deep agent.\n- Add a per-REPL `SubagentRunner` that resolves configured subagents,\nprepares child state, invokes the runnable on the parent LangGraph loop\nwhen available, and normalizes structured responses for JavaScript.\n- Install `subagent` as a frozen top-level QuickJS binding with a\nper-REPL concurrency cap of 32 calls.\n- Support dynamic response schemas for declarative subagent specs and\nreject dynamic schemas for runnable-backed subagents.\n- Add a dedicated `subagent` prompt carve-out adapted from the previous\n`swarmTask` guidance, covering the top-level API, structured return\nsemantics, explicit batched fan-out, parent-side pre-reading,\nmulti-stage array workflows, context-safe result handling, and\nacross-eval behavior.\n- Keep QuickJS middleware focused on REPL/PTC setup rather than\nmiddleware-side subagent dispatcher maps or prompt-time spec plumbing.\n- Add unit and end-to-end coverage for `subagent()` invocation,\nstructured output, malformed subagent states, last-message fallback\nbehavior, concurrency limits, prompt guidance, and availability without\nPTC.","tree":{"sha":"ce4d4d8065ce2704a1b9b660635e93fd65170380","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/ce4d4d8065ce2704a1b9b660635e93fd65170380"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/85fd7c283da6744e403a01861e17e99e13e0f481","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKz8QCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOzsQAE4CvWYVr3ZOL2T/lZr4rEDJ\nhVgYJ5tup5+W0RucCxQOW9uZjPPchK68oAUmNVptO3rbuhmqQBKhv5v3M7JSEiYF\ntM7D1j5/Q47I0+Fz8LpcZD3GwR02pOv/Ii5OEDp561RS2H0kWWmmX9T3/ijYXuzL\noBtOa8292SDHANN1rxlFvGaLjE/m+ZaTWYfk5k2LUYXwVJbyndti32gIlASc6Zlw\n0Bx6ilAKZVgUoLNhOyNVkU5EMpqvqaSF0cSILS0XPi4tjyxObjxiQnfcdPOCQzya\nVCqa6zqP+V0LFsh4Ci+EXweBsHOeOcha5wESd2J1JL5SNmLuzpVvh8jKI24cYXF9\ngLO8O33zPNFjAfcEYerWfx3WlpnYW4F//GBTZwiwTiskM73Utg+qcKn+d5MRQ0yP\nEvKheph8lh7etC7uPtgUmWAfBXdCN4cFDS9SUvobrmN5LcDEtqKclWeVV5ropuP6\n1lVVFs5SxsdSJMFpoiCWLhwM06YsZ4eGpKktikXFfx7sTa4pqa899i8ZuHB+WhfQ\ntJ7NitMz9Ykfa2+AJD/1HuH3/KjzIURpJz4hougP9XglbgcEmOI/BkoJDILLacDJ\nvgl5vrun9rNAcehFhqyyz9M+8MaqZ+fat0cIuPxjk/o4uUkY7yZTPfzjmY6mBFtk\nCHdpUr27Buk+XL9VVJGO\n=T6UJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ce4d4d8065ce2704a1b9b660635e93fd65170380\nparent 10edc061ccbefa4921de8677ed222801592c5ad4\nauthor Hunter Lovell <40191806+hntrl@users.noreply.github.com> 1781219088 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781219088 -0700\n\nfeat(quickjs)!: add default `subagent` bridge (#3850)\n\nAdds a default QuickJS `subagent()` global backed by the subagents\nconfigured on `create_deep_agent`. The bridge recreates subagents inside\nthe REPL from a private configurable payload, keeps subagent spec\nhandling out of middleware dispatcher state, and preserves private-state\nfiltering when invoking child agents.\n\nChanges:\n\n- Expose `create_sub_agent` as the shared helper for compiling\ndeclarative subagent specs, so the task tool path and QuickJS bridge use\nthe same construction path.\n- Expose normalized subagent specs from `SubAgentMiddleware` through\n`RunnableConfig.configurable` when constructing a deep agent.\n- Add a per-REPL `SubagentRunner` that resolves configured subagents,\nprepares child state, invokes the runnable on the parent LangGraph loop\nwhen available, and normalizes structured responses for JavaScript.\n- Install `subagent` as a frozen top-level QuickJS binding with a\nper-REPL concurrency cap of 32 calls.\n- Support dynamic response schemas for declarative subagent specs and\nreject dynamic schemas for runnable-backed subagents.\n- Add a dedicated `subagent` prompt carve-out adapted from the previous\n`swarmTask` guidance, covering the top-level API, structured return\nsemantics, explicit batched fan-out, parent-side pre-reading,\nmulti-stage array workflows, context-safe result handling, and\nacross-eval behavior.\n- Keep QuickJS middleware focused on REPL/PTC setup rather than\nmiddleware-side subagent dispatcher maps or prompt-time spec plumbing.\n- Add unit and end-to-end coverage for `subagent()` invocation,\nstructured output, malformed subagent states, last-message fallback\nbehavior, concurrency limits, prompt guidance, and availability without\nPTC.","verified_at":"2026-06-11T23:04:48Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/85fd7c283da6744e403a01861e17e99e13e0f481","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/85fd7c283da6744e403a01861e17e99e13e0f481","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/85fd7c283da6744e403a01861e17e99e13e0f481/comments","author":{"login":"hntrl","id":40191806,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTkxODA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40191806?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl","html_url":"https://github.com/hntrl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","st