28sogjWc\nhnUpsceebk7cC/fn7Wm4\n=VmzH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b44242960b32a6bf0733cb0a2d2ce675c61eea1b\nparent ea7dae58a37cfb1d2b96544eb7c941aad331b280\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781141971 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781141971 -0400\n\nstyle(code): reword auto-update restart toast for clarity (#3860)\n\nThe update-available toast read \"Restart dcode to auto-update before\nstartup,\" which is awkward from a UX perspective. Reworded to \"Restart\ndcode to install the update automatically.\"\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-11T01:39:32Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3ce2103887b82c67ce24bcec903eeec6b02c0af9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3ce2103887b82c67ce24bcec903eeec6b02c0af9","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3ce2103887b82c67ce24bcec903eeec6b02c0af9/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ea7dae58a37cfb1d2b96544eb7c941aad331b280","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ea7dae58a37cfb1d2b96544eb7c941aad331b280","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ea7dae58a37cfb1d2b96544eb7c941aad331b280"}]},{"sha":"ea7dae58a37cfb1d2b96544eb7c941aad331b280","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGVhN2RhZTU4YTM3Y2ZiMWQyYjk2NTQ0ZWI3Yzk0MWFhZDMzMWIyODA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-11T01:39:17Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-11T01:39:17Z"},"message":"fix(code): hand pointer over splash tracing project link (#3858)\n\nSplash-screen tracing project link now shows a hand cursor on hover in\nterminals that support pointer shapes.\n\n---\n\nThe LangSmith tracing project link in the TUI startup splash renders as\na clickable hyperlink and has an `on_click` handler, but the mouse\npointer never changed shape on hover. Because `auto_links` is disabled\n(to avoid a hover-refresh flicker), the pointer shape was never updated.\nThis adds `on_mouse_move`/`on_leave` handlers that set the widget\npointer to `pointer` (hand) over link spans, so terminals supporting the\nKitty pointer-shape protocol (e.g. Ghostty) show the hand cursor.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"00d9f90c5b29dfc52194c4415454c31dbdc3c322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/00d9f90c5b29dfc52194c4415454c31dbdc3c322"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/ea7dae58a37cfb1d2b96544eb7c941aad331b280","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKhHFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAv8YQAEYoL7LIzl6bqQeqxqP5IUND\ntWAhdK8tC4MliuXe1nEdA3lUrzot/vOwbQwxSvnpuNlx3Ov/hogQtmiHWNuuUeCV\nE2R7J3JUnkwAnm8SHUz9H6/GIkOa1Yt6GB2k1o1DodCismAX73kbvjVybSL01oCO\n7sB5v6/60wNV54WyuHxWM4Zk0DIbf+VPFwXc2C0fx1pj/vcgx5UBHFFGp0W62k9/\nXehrje69WOXoJtlHMKDWvXDJlCnQuDv/1mmvfKFjRQ9dp0UU+W0FfyC0TPCO+JIe\nW2vygNVfq4X3VaGholkWsMWpicD4KgEUftJQ54F/ZHQpwj4Ax3JygDlosef0pAd5\nk8fAPUHYuy8uQk5vHOWq3N61e3EuRjajJc0eSfG8AegYcrnazfUjSEq4USULu7vn\nMqJlVfmsepLmXiJQZjsOAqEzJ5aCTTAbN+rsbDWwu1OENigN7eirNYWQqsjvLwrU\n3lmDAPXyIWQXJzFuz4Q62XSiJ8MACyx8Fm9z/AsAnBBoeWW+Q0abOiE2r3/lKMbh\nK1nvSOcWZzYd+5Oh9DVzYuRSPCTED73IOHjN5e5U1XYoak6Vdc/LM7l2cfVxidg2\nM+BrDp5WZczIBs3IpPVu/tV+yNFbcv095Cv/BDpCM3JjBarGz/VPzgbzD7oi9s4A\nkU+AMpcf8boqTsu9rGiM\n=kjXs\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 00d9f90c5b29dfc52194c4415454c31dbdc3c322\nparent c3bc67b0cdeda6f4dbcc6360ddd72b455aec4fe7\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781141957 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781141957 -0400\n\nfix(code): hand pointer over splash tracing project link (#3858)\n\nSplash-screen tracing project link now shows a hand cursor on hover in\nterminals that support pointer shapes.\n\n---\n\nThe LangSmith tracing project link in the TUI startup splash renders as\na clickable hyperlink and has an `on_click` handler, but the mouse\npointer never changed shape on hover. Because `auto_links` is disabled\n(to avoid a hover-refresh flicker), the pointer shape was never updated.\nThis adds `on_mouse_move`/`on_leave` handlers that set the widget\npointer to `pointer` (hand) over link spans, so terminals supporting the\nKitty pointer-shape protocol (e.g. Ghostty) show the hand cursor.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-11T01:39:18Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ea7dae58a37cfb1d2b96544eb7c941aad331b280","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ea7dae58a37cfb1d2b96544eb7c941aad331b280","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ea7dae58a37cfb1d2b96544eb7c941aad331b280/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"c3bc67b0cdeda6f4dbcc6360ddd72b455aec4fe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c3bc67b0cdeda6f4dbcc6360ddd72b455aec4fe7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/c3bc67b0cdeda6f4dbcc6360ddd72b455aec4fe7"}]},{"sha":"c3bc67b0cdeda6f4dbcc6360ddd72b455aec4fe7","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGMzYmM2N2IwY2RlZGE2ZjRkYmNjNjM2MGRkZDcyYjQ1NWFlYzRmZTc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-11T01:30:51Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-11T01:30:51Z"},"message":"fix(code): keep terminal-default theme on Esc in `/theme` selector (#3854)\n\n`/theme`: pressing Esc after setting a terminal default with `t` now\nkeeps that theme instead of reverting.\n\n---\n\nIn the `/theme` selector, pressing `t` to set a per-terminal default is\na deliberate choice. Previously Esc reverted to the theme that was\nactive when the picker opened, discarding that preview. Now Esc keeps\nthe theme set with `t` this session while still restoring the original\nwhen no terminal default was set. The persisted `[ui.terminal_themes]`\nmapping remains the source of truth, so no extra `[ui].theme` write\nhappens.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"92f49887660c6af4eea8bfe28e4a880617ad6ca0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/92f49887660c6af4eea8bfe28e4a880617ad6ca0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/c3bc67b0cdeda6f4dbcc6360ddd72b455aec4fe7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKg/LCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtEQQAHN3zyRwB5fKmFLTh8l1w9GN\nvZrMCcelFR5d6ffKDBp+9TqaSLtoRyfX36WksK054Wu5K90TCcveYmkfoke0wppI\ncavrV175tEdeQQ29Y+9oYbCA89lBOUwGM7tjmXitrGLUCdMEg8/Z274pBw4f1aN3\nmA8h7sC2JloWBmNRVw2rYgrVgWtQZcELjGD+uzDdBx7CPs92aLPdKlrnwvBCcAot\niaZGAyQjgawicRAKDzBfP5xFBDBr//i50H+pFhpStd/HgMdwFPuXUZ1zuybHM2e5\n9cMQpF8rWS+KN5b3u4ljatiUSX6EciFTrlyGk59Pf1NiYxjiL2FlHaO8Zo+VZpvb\nV25pxwaLy1c5R+9GtkJncxxJ1T2eFYqgV1ehnTu/B2/k9h7IEdg+wu+uBz92ugcF\ntOjNWPMITJ1W/wZoEyKN0pHQsIPso11gNKvm6jCKerMIPzXPOMY39hmKyzKRyYx1\n0jfDttG9icmayR6kLBsNSlQZbVagsT0rrVaprNC6wuAH5f9YAHFUVVoRxC+S7BK+\nO0PIzpGUjKf5P9r0aKz6IMejioVx34NwGAqV6z7JTe+36YWpagHLEpF+LaVzNksR\nHDtqXQhCcBN3hEDj53RIE6TOtuiuGO+kouMSaWl2bOfF9FfZ4FFJvp/ydaXG3kgM\n3qNrPlrUmAavvzRuNFlh\n=KFOM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 92f49887660c6af4eea8bfe28e4a880617ad6ca0\nparent 2b635a7e6e6b50ca8ce783c2ac96ed8643ae0224\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781141451 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781141451 -0400\n\nfix(code): keep terminal-default theme on Esc in `/theme` selector (#3854)\n\n`/theme`: pressing Esc after setting a terminal default with `t` now\nkeeps that theme instead of reverting.\n\n---\n\nIn the `/theme` selector, pressing `t` to set a per-terminal default is\na deliberate choice. Previously Esc reverted to the theme that was\nactive when the picker opened, discarding that preview. Now Esc keeps\nthe theme set with `t` this session while still restoring the original\nwhen no terminal default was set. The persisted `[ui.terminal_themes]`\nmapping remains the source of truth, so no extra `[ui].theme` write\nhappens.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-11T01:30:51Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c3bc67b0cdeda6f4dbcc6360ddd72b455aec4fe7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/c3bc67b0cdeda6f4dbcc6360ddd72b455aec4fe7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c3bc67b0cdeda6f4dbcc6360ddd72b455aec4fe7/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"2b635a7e6e6b50ca8ce783c2ac96ed8643ae0224","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2b635a7e6e6b50ca8ce783c2ac96ed8643ae0224","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2b635a7e6e6b50ca8ce783c2ac96ed8643ae0224"}]},{"sha":"2b635a7e6e6b50ca8ce783c2ac96ed8643ae0224","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDJiNjM1YTdlNmU2YjUwY2E4Y2U3ODNjMmFjOTZlZDg2NDNhZTAyMjQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-11T00:58:44Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-11T00:58:44Z"},"message":"feat(code): pluggable third-party sandbox backends (#3842)\n\n`dcode` now supports third-party and internal sandbox backends as\nfirst-class providers via entry points or `[sandboxes.providers]`\nconfig, in addition to the built-in providers.\n\n---\n\n`dcode` sandbox providers were hard-coded, so every new backend required\nchanges here. This makes providers pluggable: a `SandboxRegistry` merges\ncurated built-ins (installed as `deepagents-code` extras), entry-point\nproviders published by third-party packages under\n`deepagents_code.sandbox_providers`, and config-declared providers in\n`[sandboxes.providers]` (a `class_path` with the same trust model as\nmodel `class_path`). Provider metadata (`SandboxProviderMetadata` /\n`SandboxInstallHint`) now drives the working directory, snapshot\nsupport, and install hints, so `_get_provider`,\n`get_default_working_dir`, and `verify_sandbox_deps` no longer carry\nhard-coded maps. The static `--sandbox` choices are replaced with\nregistry validation that emits install/config guidance for unknown\nproviders; bare `--sandbox` resolves `[sandboxes].default`. Config\n`params` are forwarded into `get_or_create()`.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f898a855a9eaf86d8f09e328bd2d55c4d7b1e6a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/f898a855a9eaf86d8f09e328bd2d55c4d7b1e6a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/2b635a7e6e6b50ca8ce783c2ac96ed8643ae0224","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKghECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAj00QAC3kBeE4ft6wo4U7vooIXz5k\n1OAKlP2SPGdTg1YokUUv8c9FVGN2zlQjtclHg2I3G5esxHXfDrG9Y3nHmcvl3BTI\nqK0qohy8AUzvnrKAvBSkrRp37iD+HVxxvMeJxkhWesCLdFn7QlvJVi3wd3PLRbSi\nW4JmdBaHGmeikF+VdEMtdtANARCzu4ceLHKR9V0SvCuiCZWNJvtJDJfl1xrLlH4a\nbalJYAQWy0Q2iJfqSY1qtb+VosCCZTvoqjyyD04UfkKO5LbketHLZL5KT6zOyEU2\nB77YlwvoxG+ClSRB8h1NNdmyVbUXJIqKE28/5BujooEeaLBEePwx36luighj1A6g\nx6iLSWDHf+pQ9ih1yYxIu36Vulc4/SPyBaKDyhT6dVziTVCHxshdsZG8HQ1TPQYS\n981/tBXWoOLG+MU6Gfsf+5PPhtRCxm37Qnsq61Y59/hY3aPP2IVIvoqiX6PxZhCa\nTIIV46fTjgaH1MjzAHwzAfmvsJcjctd/naP2viMC99UvknIHiae0HuqoOETylD0l\nP7R0/inr9ROa1Ef/BEbuyOdKIFZCwxcxx4xaSk+TAHCLl4OuW6qpCthzdN1m4H6A\ng109ZJ/rZWuK6P62PR176Hz+N36v/3T0B+aXVytfBwXGFJx29T5FAxur75RaHS7r\nLitZ2nRCiyPJ/OM3sbZ3\n=IJk/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree f898a855a9eaf86d8f09e328bd2d55c4d7b1e6a4\nparent 9334d91ef94997e46d5373daca9c146fa9498763\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781139524 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781139524 -0400\n\nfeat(code): pluggable third-party sandbox backends (#3842)\n\n`dcode` now supports third-party and internal sandbox backends as\nfirst-class providers via entry points or `[sandboxes.providers]`\nconfig, in addition to the built-in providers.\n\n---\n\n`dcode` sandbox providers were hard-coded, so every new backend required\nchanges here. This makes providers pluggable: a `SandboxRegistry` merges\ncurated built-ins (installed as `deepagents-code` extras), entry-point\nproviders published by third-party packages under\n`deepagents_code.sandbox_providers`, and config-declared providers in\n`[sandboxes.providers]` (a `class_path` with the same trust model as\nmodel `class_path`). Provider metadata (`SandboxProviderMetadata` /\n`SandboxInstallHint`) now drives the working directory, snapshot\nsupport, and install hints, so `_get_provider`,\n`get_default_working_dir`, and `verify_sandbox_deps` no longer carry\nhard-coded maps. The static `--sandbox` choices are replaced with\nregistry validation that emits install/config guidance for unknown\nproviders; bare `--sandbox` resolves `[sandboxes].default`. Config\n`params` are forwarded into `get_or_create()`.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-11T00:58:45Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2b635a7e6e6b50ca8ce783c2ac96ed8643ae0224","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2b635a7e6e6b50ca8ce783c2ac96ed8643ae0224","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2b635a7e6e6b50ca8ce783c2ac96ed8643ae0224/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"9334d91ef94997e46d5373daca9c146fa9498763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9334d91ef94997e46d5373daca9c146fa9498763","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9334d91ef94997e46d5373daca9c146fa9498763"}]},{"sha":"9334d91ef94997e46d5373daca9c146fa9498763","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDkzMzRkOTFlZjk0OTk3ZTQ2ZDUzNzNkYWNhOWMxNDZmYTk0OTg3NjM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-10T23:41:56Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-10T23:41:56Z"},"message":"feat(code): first-class `[retries]` config (#3772)\n\n[Docs](https://github.com/langchain-ai/docs/pull/4318)\n\nAdd configurable model retry counts for supported and custom dcode\nproviders.\n\n---\n\nAdds a typed top-level `[retries]` config and `--max-retries` override\nso a single transient provider error does not end a dcode run when users\nopt into retries.\n\nThe retry config now applies to registered retry-capable providers and\nsupports arbitrary chat model providers via\n`[retries.<provider>].param`, so users can name the constructor kwarg\nwhen it is not `max_retries`. Precedence is: CLI `--max-retries` >\n`--model-params` > provider `params` > provider `[retries]` > global\n`[retries]` > SDK default.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5bceb19b186668de03467473eac618b28576a823","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/5bceb19b186668de03467473eac618b28576a823"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/9334d91ef94997e46d5373daca9c146fa9498763","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKfZECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7V8QAFcmPTio96cNLjnyeSRcvdq8\nwYODysDwlzZPJWcq1ZdrrzXeMkrhJydDGJxTUkDOUGWAMOOn++FyOGQidtlQncLF\nbmO3zGPGWAe63kx4nE4LNIyjfKtm5skYTTpbgus74etLgQDEHLYkajvud9SfeLzr\nQkqUDHxIB8yLuT5TGciHjOV81WQYEG95kPR6066v8212GsHdW25o69Z3Kr58VDxz\nUfuoqo3E7OAbe9joMSujlyJry3zUOOiTd5Njm6N6C6bhNKwsBKn4iKumUItvVU1a\nrm/Hc8lhhr/drk3QzgJZ0y7MfgHmr2zaHrhgQil9AWXarg1CBn1VbwToVxgAqBhp\nYDfuLXapxLleKWWrafKlcoFntIS0YWFyOlJMg29kjEeU8P2VrR/bp82cUaAm99VR\nXe1r8zDAqth6X8ZamenzmzVJ8XAY4n53cSdFwDVS2nx0BOJQ8wYVg79tTy7Gw0Jg\nND9ANeECmrbNsCLBKBNWptzMzzdOHK35Dlxfwu6II+7O5DycEdwtxBPhYhJIOVBn\n2Oz3xsTcyOis/ZCNoTzobRmv7aOt8L0Jy42G8QAMGMwGyLLC0roQ9rNfJHrjCV9v\nawWosrestvWHWdtkyZx5BKH+A8DRQGn8fQLT1HipzQYZsAQ7RyO8+EYQJz+Vdevi\nzaEiM+fObs52cIT4OoVP\n=RGOz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5bceb19b186668de03467473eac618b28576a823\nparent 2683db546124be7f973dcc75888504329cbc87ed\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781134916 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781134916 -0400\n\nfeat(code): first-class `[retries]` config (#3772)\n\n[Docs](https://github.com/langchain-ai/docs/pull/4318)\n\nAdd configurable model retry counts for supported and custom dcode\nproviders.\n\n---\n\nAdds a typed top-level `[retries]` config and `--max-retries` override\nso a single transient provider error does not end a dcode run when users\nopt into retries.\n\nThe retry config now applies to registered retry-capable providers and\nsupports arbitrary chat model providers via\n`[retries.<provider>].param`, so users can name the constructor kwarg\nwhen it is not `max_retries`. Precedence is: CLI `--max-retries` >\n`--model-params` > provider `params` > provider `[retries]` > global\n`[retries]` > SDK default.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-10T23:41:57Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9334d91ef94997e46d5373daca9c146fa9498763","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9334d91ef94997e46d5373daca9c146fa9498763","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9334d91ef94997e46d5373daca9c146fa9498763/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/